{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/gcse-exam-support-materials-minister-for-school-standards-writes-to-ofqual","content_id":"9a822376-491d-45ad-af31-6fd224a59ba8","description":"This letter outlines the Department for Education’s decision on arrangements for the current specifications of GCSE maths, physics and combined science.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69a1b78801cc32678a5bd709","filename":"Letter_from_Minister_for_School_Standards_to_Ofqual__26_February_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":169367,"filename":"Letter_from_Minister_for_School_Standards_to_Ofqual__26_February_2026.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9156481","isbn":"","number_of_pages":1,"title":"Letter from Minister for School Standards to Ofqual","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a1b78801cc32678a5bd709/Letter_from_Minister_for_School_Standards_to_Ofqual__26_February_2026.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Georgia Gould, Minister for School Standards, outlines the department’s decision on the arrangements for GCSE maths, physics and combined science.</p>\n\n<p>Students taking qualifications in these subjects in 2025, 2026 and 2027 will not need to memorise formulae and equations. They will continue to be provided with these in their assessments.</p>\n\n<p>The minister asks Ofqual to consider appropriate arrangements to maintain this support to students for the lifetime of the current GCSE specifications.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/letter-in-response-to-dfe-policy-decision-on-formulae-and-equations-sheets\">Ofqual has replied to the minister</a>. It has confirmed the decision to consult on the need for exam boards to continue providing formulae and equation sheets, as in previous years.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/proposed-changes-to-the-assessment-of-mathematics-physics-and-combined-science-gcses\">Ofqual’s consultation</a> closes on 23 March 2026 at 11.45pm.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-26T00:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a1b78801cc32678a5bd709/Letter_from_Minister_for_School_Standards_to_Ofqual__26_February_2026.pdf\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--pdf\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 99 140\">\n  <path d=\"M12,59h9v9h-9v-9ZM30,77v9h39v-9H30ZM30,104h57v-9H30v9ZM30,122h48v-9H30v9ZM12,86h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,122h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,104h9v-9h-9v9ZM30,68h57v-9H30v9ZM35.2,21c-.3-.2-.6-.4-1-.5s-.8-.2-1.3-.2h-2.6v5.5h2.6c.5,0,1,0,1.3-.2s.7-.3,1-.5c.3-.2.5-.5.7-.8s.2-.7.2-1.1h0c0-.5,0-.9-.2-1.2-.2-.3-.4-.6-.7-.8h0ZM52.4,21.9c-.4-.5-1-.9-1.6-1.1-.7-.3-1.5-.4-2.4-.4h-2.7v11.5h2.7c.9,0,1.7-.1,2.4-.4s1.2-.7,1.6-1.1c.4-.5.7-1.1.9-1.7.2-.7.3-1.4.3-2.1v-.7c0-.8,0-1.5-.3-2.1-.2-.6-.5-1.2-.9-1.7h0ZM87,12v27H12V12h75ZM39.8,23c0-.9-.1-1.6-.4-2.4-.3-.7-.7-1.4-1.2-1.9-.5-.5-1.2-1-1.9-1.2-.8-.3-1.6-.5-2.5-.5h-7.2v17.9h3.6v-6h3.2c.9,0,1.8-.1,2.6-.5.8-.3,1.4-.7,2-1.2.5-.5,1-1.2,1.3-1.9.3-.7.5-1.5.5-2.4h0ZM57.4,26c0-1.3-.2-2.6-.5-3.7s-.9-2-1.6-2.8c-.7-.8-1.6-1.4-2.7-1.8-1.1-.4-2.3-.6-3.8-.6h-6.6v17.9h6.6c1.5,0,2.7-.2,3.8-.6,1.1-.4,2-1,2.7-1.8.7-.8,1.3-1.7,1.6-2.8.4-1.1.5-2.3.5-3.7h0ZM72.4,17.1h-12.1v17.9h3.6v-7.5h7.8v-3.3h-7.8v-3.8h8.4s0-3.3,0-3.3Z\" />\n</svg>\n\n</a></div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a1b78801cc32678a5bd709/Letter_from_Minister_for_School_Standards_to_Ofqual__26_February_2026.pdf\">Letter from Minister for School Standards to Ofqual</a>\n</h2>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Portable Document Format\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">PDF</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">165 KB</span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">1 page</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n</div></section>"],"emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9156481"],"first_public_at":"2026-02-26T00:00:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-02-26T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/gcse-exam-support-materials-minister-for-school-standards-writes-to-ofqual","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/gcse-exam-support-materials-minister-for-school-standards-writes-to-ofqual","base_path":"/government/publications/gcse-exam-support-materials-minister-for-school-standards-writes-to-ofqual","content_id":"9a822376-491d-45ad-af31-6fd224a59ba8","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-26T00:00:00Z","schema_na